        <mxCell id="GyV2wykm-IdrSrDU3RWV-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Initializing VM with app in VMSS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;One option is to initialize create VMSS with user data eg (cloud-init.yml)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;And the user data in eg cloud-init.yaml will have steps for &lt;b&gt;openliberty installation&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;getting app war from Blob storage&lt;/b&gt; and deploy it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;This user data will run only during VM initialization, so for deploying new apps the VMSS need to be updated with new user data and reimaged.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
